                  "resource_id": "feat",
                  "stats": {
                    "name": {
                      "value": "Mind Flayer's Psionics"
                    },
                    "prerequisites": {
                      "value": ""
                    },
                    "descriptions": {
                      "value": [
                        {
                          "resource_id": "levelled_description",
                          "stats": {
                            "level": {
                              "value": 1
                            },
                            "description": {
                              "value": "You can spend your psionic points to cause any of the following effects.\n\n- Psionic Blast (1 psionic point): As an action you let loose a quick burst of psionic energy at a target within 5 feet of you. That target must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save it takes 2d8 necrotic damage. On a success, it takes half as much. The damage increases to 3d8 at 5th level, 4d8 at 11th level, and 5d8 at 17th level.\n- Nova Rupture (3 psionic points): As an action you hurl a ball of psionic energy at a point you can see within 30 feet. All Medium or smaller creatures within 5 feet of that point must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save they are shoved 20 feet in a direction of your choosing, which can be straight upward."
                            },
                            "id": "cf7ce97d-5f62-49a4-bd6f-cc853f1dc38e",
